# Passkeys need the browser's WebAuthn API; use a browser for the ceremony.
# These show the JSON endpoints that the generated pages call.
@base = http://localhost:8123

### registration options (signed-in session + _csrf header)
POST {{base}}/webauthn/register/options
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### authentication options (challenge)
POST {{base}}/webauthn/authenticate/options
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### registered passkeys page
GET {{base}}/webauthn/register
